  "description": "Fuaran incremental re-derivation engine — effect-aware memoisation over the Phase 180 artifact-function apply. Caches substituted fragment trees keyed by (function-identity, arg-set); a value-parameter change reuses the structural tree and recomputes only the affected hole-addressed bindings; effecting functions bypass the cache; op-stream replay resolves through the cache to a byte-identical tree. Apache-2.0 licensed.",
